              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bazana ivyo gusasa, n’amabesani n’ibibumvye mw’ibumba. Bazana n’ingano na sayiri, amafu n’ingano zikaranze, ibiharage n’ubushaza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.28",
