        {
          "text": "ubuki, amavuta avuye mu mikuku y’inka, amaforomaji y’inka vya Dawidi n’abantu biwe ngo bafungure. Kuko bavuze bati: “Abantu barashonje, bararushe kandi baranyotewe kubera ubugaragwa.”",
